# 📊 Diagramy Flow - Rejestracja Użytkowników

## 1. Pełny Flow Rejestracji (Happy Path)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Middleware
    participant RegisterPage as register.astro
    participant RegisterForm as RegisterForm.tsx
    participant API as /api/auth/register
    participant Supabase
    participant Email

    User->>Browser: Wejście na /register
    Browser->>Middleware: GET /register
    Middleware->>Middleware: Check session
    alt User zalogowany
        Middleware->>Browser: Redirect to /trips
    else User niezalogowany
        Middleware->>RegisterPage: Continue
        RegisterPage->>RegisterPage: Per-page check
        RegisterPage->>Browser: Render RegisterForm
        Browser->>User: Display form
    end

    User->>RegisterForm: Fill form + Submit
    RegisterForm->>RegisterForm: Client validation
    RegisterForm->>API: POST /api/auth/register
    API->>API: Zod validation
    API->>Supabase: auth.signUp()
    Supabase->>Supabase: Create user
    Supabase->>Email: Send confirmation email
    Supabase->>API: Return success
    API->>RegisterForm: 201 Created
    RegisterForm->>Browser: Show success screen
    Browser->>User: "Sprawdź email!"
    
    Note over Browser,User: Wait 3 seconds
    
    RegisterForm->>Browser: window.location.href = "/login?message=registration_success"
    Browser->>User: Redirect to login page

    User->>Email: Open email
    User->>Email: Click confirmation link
    Email->>Supabase: Confirm email
    Supabase->>Supabase: Set email_confirmed = true
    Supabase->>Browser: Redirect to app
    Browser->>User: "Email potwierdzony!"
```

