## 4. Email Confirmation Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Supabase
    participant Email
    participant Browser
    participant LoginAPI as /api/auth/login

    Note over User,Supabase: Po rejestracji
    Supabase->>Email: Send confirmation email
    Note over Email: Email w skrzynce użytkownika
    
    alt Scenario A: User confirms email
        User->>Email: Open email
        User->>Email: Click confirmation link
        Email->>Supabase: GET /auth/v1/verify?token=xxx
        Supabase->>Supabase: Mark email_confirmed = true
        Supabase->>Browser: Redirect to app
        Browser->>User: "Email potwierdzony!"
        
        User->>Browser: Navigate to /login
        User->>LoginAPI: POST credentials
        LoginAPI->>Supabase: signInWithPassword()
        Supabase->>LoginAPI: ✅ Success + session
        LoginAPI->>Browser: Redirect to /trips
    end
    
    alt Scenario B: User tries to login WITHOUT confirming
        User->>Browser: Navigate to /login
        User->>LoginAPI: POST credentials
        LoginAPI->>Supabase: signInWithPassword()
        Supabase->>LoginAPI: ❌ Email not confirmed
        LoginAPI->>Browser: Error message
        Browser->>User: "Sprawdź email i potwierdź konto"
    end
```

