## 6. State Machine - Registration Form

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle: Page loaded
    
    Idle --> Typing: User types
    Typing --> Typing: Continues typing
    Typing --> Submitting: Clicks "Register"
    
    Submitting --> ClientValidation: Validate form
    
    ClientValidation --> ShowError: Validation fails
    ClientValidation --> APICall: Validation passes
    
    ShowError --> Typing: User fixes input
    
    APICall --> Processing: Fetch /api/auth/register
    
    Processing --> ShowError: API error (400/409/500)
    Processing --> Success: 201 Created
    
    Success --> Redirecting: Show success screen
    
    Redirecting --> [*]: Navigate to /login (3s)
    
    note right of Success
        "Sprawdź email!"
        "Link potwierdzający został wysłany"
    end note
    
    note right of ShowError
        Errors:
        - Validation errors
        - User already exists
        - Network errors
    end note
```

