## 8. Error Handling Flowchart

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start[API receives request] --> Parse{Parse JSON}
    Parse -->|Fail| E1[❌ 400 Bad Request]
    Parse -->|Success| Validate{Zod Validation}
    
    Validate -->|Fail| E2[❌ 400 Validation Error<br/>with field name]
    Validate -->|Success| SignUp[supabase.auth.signUp]
    
    SignUp --> Check{Check error}
    Check -->|User exists| E3[❌ 409 Conflict<br/>'Email już istnieje']
    Check -->|Password weak| E4[❌ 400 Bad Request<br/>'Hasło za słabe']
    Check -->|Email invalid| E5[❌ 400 Bad Request<br/>'Email nieprawidłowy']
    Check -->|Other error| E6[❌ 500 Internal Error]
    Check -->|No error| Success{User created?}
    
    Success -->|No user data| E7[❌ 500 Internal Error]
    Success -->|User data OK| S1[✅ 201 Created<br/>Return user info]
    
    style S1 fill:#90EE90
    style E1 fill:#FFB6C1
    style E2 fill:#FFB6C1
    style E3 fill:#FFB6C1
    style E4 fill:#FFB6C1
    style E5 fill:#FFB6C1
    style E6 fill:#FFB6C1
    style E7 fill:#FFB6C1
```

